<span class="eyebrow">Services</span>
<h1>Bathroom renovation and design in Toronto</h1>
<p>A bathroom packs a lot into a small room: plumbing, waterproofing, ventilation, storage, lighting and finishes that have to last. Renotect designs bathrooms around how you use them, shows you the room in 3D before anything is ordered, and follows the work on site so the finished room matches the design.</p>
<div class="cta" style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn" href="/#contact">Book a free consultation</a><a class="btn alt" href="/projects/custom-millwork/">See our custom vanities</a></div>
</div></section>

